			"date": "2025-01-27T15:27:32.492Z",
			"content": "<p>yeah – but the power part here would be it's a runtime thing</p>\n<p>you could allow a defined set and then let people jus' throw updates in the HTML with it all covered by that one line 😅</p>\n<p>mayhem</p>",
