			"date": "2025-01-27T15:47:07.029Z",
			"content": "<p>Maybe I’m reading too much into this, but wouldn’t you prefer to do it like this?</p>\n<p>&lt;SVG class=“youKnowWhat”…&gt;</p>\n<p>.youKnowWhat {<br>\n    display: hidden;<br>\n}</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqcu3bti22r",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:5vj7hql7jstm5vfppjir3rww/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqbylbkl22m",
