				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/zachleat.com",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-01-27T16:02:29.784Z",
			"content": "<p>plenty of fine ways to do this (though you’d want `display: none` not hidden there). `&lt;svg hidden&gt;` might be the best one!</p>\n<p>in this specific case it’s for an SVG spritesheet.</p>",
