				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:i4ichiot767r3h5gvezwt2hr/bafkreigl3a2qplenywwoxeglw4lxb3blwpngj4rofm36izcsp5ffaldtlm"
			},
			"date": "2025-01-27T16:24:50.336Z",
			"content": "<p>Not sure if it’s still an issue when using &lt;use&gt; with a svg sprite/asset  - but back in the old days display:none broke &lt;defs&gt; <br>\nstyle=”width:0;height:0;position:absolute;” focusable=“false” is what I’m using (maybe I ought to do a do-we-still-need-this l)</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
