				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/bafkreie4yypxcxrte6shppdo6glzt7gtmueprazp3xndeksuw2uid2ecfm"
			},
			"date": "2025-01-27T17:59:32.444Z",
			"content": "<p>so… this might be a stupid question but why doesn’t &lt;svg hidden&gt;&lt;/svg&gt; hide the svg 😅 <a href=\"https://codepen.io/zachleat/pen/VYZqXaP/ed6c50d0fea2568ca9995d9c10c2fccf?editors=1100\">codepen.io/zachleat/pen...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:cfzewyyzcr75z4t3vhew6o7g/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqm2qo3xc2p",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqjfemevs2l",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/shaw.city/post/3lgqm2qo3xc2p",
			"author": {
				"name": "Shaw",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/shaw.city",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:cfzewyyzcr75z4t3vhew6o7g/bafkreicvtneuyuqc6j64n67w423d2zsu2iu44rytxwyjnnkqbnhvql7s4a"
			},
			"date": "2025-01-27T18:47:17.207Z",
			"content": "<p>Odd! Looks like default browser styles aren't including `display: none` for svg[hidden]. Might only apply to HTML elements by default, as SVG2 spec doesn't list it under the attributes. <br>\n<a href=\"https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG2/struct.html#NewDocument\">www.w3.org/TR/SVG2/stru...</a></p>\n<p>Adding `[hidden] { display:none }` to CSS will do it, but maybe that's wrong for this</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:cfzewyyzcr75z4t3vhew6o7g/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqmclznj22p",
			"parentId": "at://did:plc:cfzewyyzcr75z4t3vhew6o7g/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqm2qo3xc2p",
			"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/shaw.city/post/3lgqmclznj22p",
			"author": {
				"name": "Shaw",
				"url": "https://bsky.app/profile/shaw.city",
				"avatarUrl": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:cfzewyyzcr75z4t3vhew6o7g/bafkreicvtneuyuqc6j64n67w423d2zsu2iu44rytxwyjnnkqbnhvql7s4a"
			},
			"date": "2025-01-27T18:51:40.781Z",
			"content": "<p>Hidden spec for reference: <a href=\"https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-hidden-attribute\">html.spec.whatwg.org#the-hidden-a...</a></p>\n<p>Doesn't directly address &lt;svg&gt; that I can tell. Hard to say what the broswer's choice is there.</p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
		{
			"id": "at://did:plc:xpchjovbk6sxl3bv74z7cs54/app.bsky.feed.post/3lgqmflpkxc2e",
